       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTACCR.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PRINCIPAL  PIC 9(7) VALUE 10000.
       01 WS-INTEREST   PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DAY        PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM ACCRUE-DAILY.
           DISPLAY WS-INTEREST.
           STOP RUN.
       ACCRUE-DAILY.
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-DAY >= 30
               ADD 3 TO WS-INTEREST
               ADD 1 TO WS-DAY
           END-PERFORM.
